  <string name="developed_by_full">polar tasks v1.5\ndeveloped by rezzt.dev</string>
  
  <!-- Tutorial -->
  <string name="tutorial_title_1">welcome to polar.</string>
  <string name="tutorial_desc_1">the minimalist app meticulously designed to organise your tasks and reminders as elegantly as possible.\n\ndiscover how to boost your daily productivity while staying in control, without distractions and with exceptional performance.</string>
  <string name="tutorial_title_2">task management</string>
  <string name="tutorial_desc_2">group your responsibilities by creating dedicated lists for work, home or special projects, and organise everything with tags.\n\nbreak down big goals by adding unlimited subtasks and see your progress in a completely visual and satisfying way.</string>
  <string name="tutorial_title_3">smart creation</string>
  <string name="tutorial_desc_3">write completely naturally: "buy bread at 5pm on Tuesday" or "meeting tomorrow morning".\n\nour powerful smart engine will detect and extract the date and time automatically, scheduling the task for you.</string>
  <string name="tutorial_title_4">quick actions</string>
  <string name="tutorial_desc_4">smoothly swipe a task to the right on the list to immediately mark it as completed.\n\nmade a mistake or no longer need to do something? swipe left to delete it without opening any menus.</string>
  <string name="tutorial_title_5">calendar and notifications</string>
  <string name="tutorial_desc_5">visualise all your routines grouped month by month or by weeks in our premium-designed calendar.\n\nreceive accurate notifications just on time so you never miss a meeting, delivery or important detail again.</string>
  <string name="tutorial_title_6">total personalisation</string>
  <string name="tutorial_desc_6">adapt the app to your own style with our 4 visual modes: dark, light, multicolour dark and multicolour light.\n\nplus, you can pick the typography that suits you best from a curated selection of professional fonts.</string>
  <string name="tutorial_title_7">statistics and progress</string>
  <string name="tutorial_desc_7">keep an exhaustive log of your day to day, viewing completed, overdue tasks and your best productive day.\n\nmaintain long streaks of completion to outdo yourself and achieve everything you set out to do with polar\'s data.</string>
  
